      {
        "id": "photos",
        "category": "selling",
        "q": "What photos should I upload?",
        "a": "Add clear photos of the exterior, interior, engine bay, and any damage. Keep each file under 15 MB. More photos usually get more views."
      },
      {
        "id": "price-calc",
        "category": "services",
        "q": "How does the price calculator work?",
        "a": "It looks at similar active sale listings and returns a median market estimate plus a typical price range. Fill in manufacturer and model at minimum; year, engine, and drive make the estimate tighter."
      },
      {
        "id": "customs-fee",
        "category": "services",
        "q": "How is customs calculated?",
        "a": "Open Customs in Services. Import tax uses cubic capacity and vehicle age: (cc × 0.05) + (cc × age × 0.0025). Other fees such as excise and registration are listed in the breakdown, in US dollars."
      },
      {
        "id": "title",
        "category": "services",
        "q": "What is title transfer?",
        "a": "It is a booked ownership transfer appointment. You pay a $49 reservation fee now and the remaining transfer fee on site. Choose car or motorcycle, then pick a date and time."
      },
